OL,3,GNEWSAParacetamol and amphetamine caused
OL,4,Awoman's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 23-year-old woman who went missing
OL,7,Fdied from "the effects of amphetamine
OL,8,Fand paracetamol", an inquest has heard.
OL,10,FJenny Hall, 23, from Tow Law in County
OL,11,FDurham, disappeared on 18 February
OL,12,F2025. A red Ford Focus belonging to the
OL,13,Fkeen long-distance runner was found
OL,14,Fparked between Eggleston and Stanhope.
OL,16,FAfter a five-day search by emergency
OL,17,Fservices and mountain rescue teams, her
OL,18,Fbody was found in a stream on 23
OL,19,FFebruary, shortly after 09:30 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
