OL,3,GNEWSAParacetamol and amphetamine caused
OL,4,Awoman's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior Coroner Crispin Oliver confirmed
OL,7,Fa post-mortem examination gave the
OL,8,Fcause of death as "the effects of
OL,9,Famphetamine and paracetamol". The
OL,10,Finquest will conclude later this month.
